{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260525_220022_p3_b7", "persona_id": "db:3", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "1. 在店内场景下，客户要求证据时必须立即执行现场演示或截图发送，不可仅口头描述。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260525_220507"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260525_220022_p3_b7", "persona_id": "db:3", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "2. 价格信息必须准确一致，一旦出错要立即提供可视化证据（官网截图、价格表）来重建信任。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260525_220507"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260525_220022_p3_b7", "persona_id": "db:3", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "3. 客户反复要求同一证据时，应优先满足该需求，而非转移话题到其他方案。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260525_220507"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260525_220022_p3_b7", "persona_id": "db:3", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "4. 对于高价格敏感客户，应提前准备替代方案（如套装优惠）并现场计算对比。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260525_220507"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260525_220022_p3_b7", "persona_id": "db:3", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "5. 地区一致性：确保报价货币与客户所在市场一致（本例为RM），引用域名需在可信信源清单内（consumer.huawei.com/en）。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260525_220507"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260525_220022_p3_b7", "persona_id": "db:3", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "name": "现场证据破信任法", "condition": "客户对价格或信息真实性产生怀疑时", "example": "立即打开官网或系统，将屏幕转向客户或截图发送，同时口头确认：“您看，这是官网实时价格。”", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260525_220507"}
